<!--
  Mapa MIDI do Neural DSP Archetype: Petrucci X, para o PluginSpec em
  src/plugins/petrucci.ts.

  === De onde vieram os target="" ===

  Nao sairam de analogia com os outros plugins. O arquivo

    %APPDATA%\Neural DSP\Archetype Petrucci X\Archetype Petrucci X.settings

  guarda o estado do plugin em <VALUE name="filterState" val="<n>.<base64>"/>,
  que e um MemoryBlock::toBase64Encoding do JUCE (tabela
  ".ABC...XYZabc...xyz0123456789+", empacotamento LSB-first). Decodificado, o
  blob e o appModel do plugin em XML puro, com um atributo por parametro — ou
  seja, a lista dos nomes internos, de graca e sem MIDI Learn.

  O metodo foi validado contra o Tim Henson X, cujos 79 targets ja estavam
  confirmados por export real: 72 deles aparecem no appModel decodificado com o
  nome identico. Os 7 que faltam sao exatamente os estruturais — o seletor
  (ampType) e os bypasses de secao —, que no appModel nao tem nome proprio: sao
  atributos `sectionActive` de <xParameters>. A regra que o Henson confirma
  6 de 6 e <xParameters sectionActive> -> target "xActive", e e ela que gera as
  sete ultimas linhas deste arquivo.

  === Resultado da conferencia (export real) ===

  Mapa fechado: os 91 targets estao confirmados por export real.

  87 acertaram de primeira. Os 83 lidos do appModel acertaram TODOS; as 4
  divergencias sao todas do grupo derivado por regra, que era exatamente onde
  se esperava errar:

    CC 110  wahCompActive ->  wahCompActiveID
    CC 111  preFXActive   ->  preFXActiveID
    CC 115  volumeActive  ->  volumeActiveID
    CC 116  postFXActive  ->  postFXActiveID

  Ou seja: a regra <xParameters sectionActive> -> "xActive" esta INCOMPLETA. As
  secoes de efeito levam sufixo "ID" (wahComp, preFX, volume, postFX), as de
  cadeia de sinal nao (amp, cab, eq). O Gojira ja dava a pista e ela passou
  batida: la tambem era `pedalsActiveID` no meio de `ampsActive`/`eqActive`/
  `cabActive`. Mas o Tim Henson tem `preFXActive` SEM o sufixo, entao a regra
  nao atravessa plugins — para bypass de secao, so o export decide.

  === Armadilhas de nome que o appModel revelou ===

  - "Middle" nao e uniforme: piezoMiddle e rhythmMiddle, mas cleanMid e leadMid.
  - Level/Output vem invertido em relacao ao Tim Henson. No Henson o trim de
    saida se chama internamente *Output e aparece como "Level" na GUI; aqui a
    GUI diz "Output" e o nome interno e *Level. O *Master e o mesmo nos dois.
  - O compressor e "compressor*" (como no Soldano), nao "comp*" (como no
    Henson), e nao tem Attack.
  - piezoAir, cleanBright, rhythmBite, rhythmMidBoost e leadSoar sao booleanos,
    apesar de estarem no dropdown lado a lado com knobs.

  === O que ficou de fora, e por que ===

  - A secao de cabinete inteira (2 mics x tipo/posicao/distancia/nivel/pan/fase
    + 2 rooms): microfonacao, que a spec poe fora de escopo. 22 mapeamentos.
  - As bandas do EQ parametrico: sao 4 Freq + 4 Gain + HPF + LPF por amp, vezes
    3 amps = 30 mapeamentos, que estourariam o teto de ~100. So os tres toggles
    entram, e o papel deles e desligar o EQ que veio do preset.
  - Cortes de delay e reverb, delaySync, delayNote L/R, delayTempo,
    delayCrossfeed, delayCrystals, metronomo e navegacao de preset.

  CC 20..116, canal 1 (midiChannel="0", 0-indexed) — o mesmo canal que a app usa
  (status byte 0xB0). CC 6..19, 62..65 e 103..109 vagos de proposito (64 e
  sustain pedal por convencao MIDI). data2 e value nao importam para
  type="cc_absolute" (o plugin recalcula value a partir do CC recebido).

  Seletor de amp: ampType (CC 20) tem QUATRO posicoes aqui, nao tres. Os valores
  em petrucci.ts (0/42/85/127) saem da hipotese do AudioParameterChoice do JUCE
  e precisam do ritual de Fase 0 (PLUGIN=petrucci npm run probe + amptest) antes
  de virarem verdade.

  Instalacao: copie este arquivo para
    %APPDATA%\Neural DSP\Archetype Petrucci X\MIDI\
  e carregue pela janela MIDI Mappings (serie X usa subpasta "MIDI").
-->

<midi>
  <routings>

    <!-- ============================ GLOBAL ================================ -->
    <routing type="cc_absolute" target="gateActive" midiChannel="0" data1="1" data2="0" value="0.0" enabled="1"/>
    <routing type="cc_absolute" target="gateThreshold" midiChannel="0" data1="2" data2="0" value="0.0" enabled="1"/>
    <routing type="cc_absolute" target="transpose" midiChannel="0" data1="3" data2="0" value="0.0" enabled="1"/>
    <routing type="cc_absolute" target="doublerActive" midiChannel="0" data1="4" data2="0" value="0.0" enabled="1"/>
    <routing type="cc_absolute" target="doublerSpread" midiChannel="0" data1="5" data2="0" value="0.0" enabled="1"/>

    <!-- ======================== SELETOR DE AMP ============================ -->
    <!-- GUI: "Amp Type" — Piezo / Clean / Rhythm / Lead -->
    <routing type="cc_absolute" target="ampType" midiChannel="0" data1="20" data2="0" value="0.0" enabled="1"/>

    <!-- ============ AMP PIEZO (captador piezo do Majesty) ================= -->
    <!-- Sem Gain e sem Master: nao ha estagio de ganho. Body e Air so ele tem,
         e Air e um toggle, nao um knob. -->
    <routing type="cc_absolute" target="piezoBody" midiChannel="0" data1="21" data2="0" value="0.0" enabled="1"/>
    <routing type="cc_absolute" target="piezoAir" midiChannel="0" data1="22" data2="0" value="0.0" enabled="1"/>
    <routing type="cc_absolute" target="piezoBass" midiChannel="0" data1="23" data2="0" value="0.0" enabled="1"/>
    <routing type="cc_absolute" target="piezoMiddle" midiChannel="0" data1="24" data2="0" value="0.0" enabled="1"/>
    <routing type="cc_absolute" target="piezoTreble" midiChannel="0" data1="25" data2="0" value="0.0" enabled="1"/>
    <routing type="cc_absolute" target="piezoPresence" midiChannel="0" data1="26" data2="0" value="0.0" enabled="1"/>
    <routing type="cc_absolute" target="piezoLevel" midiChannel="0" data1="27" data2="0" value="0.0" enabled="1"/>

    <!-- ===================== AMP CLEAN (limpo) ============================ -->
    <!-- cleanMid, nao cleanMiddle -->
    <routing type="cc_absolute" target="cleanGain" midiChannel="0" data1="28" data2="0" value="0.0" enabled="1"/>
    <routing type="cc_absolute" target="cleanBright" midiChannel="0" data1="29" data2="0" value="0.0" enabled="1"/>
    <routing type="cc_absolute" target="cleanBass" midiChannel="0" data1="30" data2="0" value="0.0" enabled="1"/>
    <routing type="cc_absolute" target="cleanMid" midiChannel="0" data1="31" data2="0" value="0.0" enabled="1"/>
    <routing type="cc_absolute" target="cleanTreble" midiChannel="0" data1="32" data2="0" value="0.0" enabled="1"/>
    <routing type="cc_absolute" target="cleanPresence" midiChannel="0" data1="33" data2="0" value="0.0" enabled="1"/>
    <routing type="cc_absolute" target="cleanMaster" midiChannel="0" data1="34" data2="0" value="0.0" enabled="1"/>
    <routing type="cc_absolute" target="cleanLevel" midiChannel="0" data1="35" data2="0" value="0.0" enabled="1"/>

    <!-- ==================== AMP RHYTHM (crunch/riff) ====================== -->
    <!-- rhythmMiddle (com "dle"); Bite e Mid Boost sao toggles, Tight e knob -->
    <routing type="cc_absolute" target="rhythmGain" midiChannel="0" data1="36" data2="0" value="0.0" enabled="1"/>
    <routing type="cc_absolute" target="rhythmBite" midiChannel="0" data1="37" data2="0" value="0.0" enabled="1"/>
    <routing type="cc_absolute" target="rhythmTight" midiChannel="0" data1="38" data2="0" value="0.0" enabled="1"/>
    <routing type="cc_absolute" target="rhythmBass" midiChannel="0" data1="39" data2="0" value="0.0" enabled="1"/>
    <routing type="cc_absolute" target="rhythmMiddle" midiChannel="0" data1="40" data2="0" value="0.0" enabled="1"/>
    <routing type="cc_absolute" target="rhythmMidBoost" midiChannel="0" data1="41" data2="0" value="0.0" enabled="1"/>
    <routing type="cc_absolute" target="rhythmTreble" midiChannel="0" data1="42" data2="0" value="0.0" enabled="1"/>
    <routing type="cc_absolute" target="rhythmPresence" midiChannel="0" data1="43" data2="0" value="0.0" enabled="1"/>
    <routing type="cc_absolute" target="rhythmMaster" midiChannel="0" data1="44" data2="0" value="0.0" enabled="1"/>
    <routing type="cc_absolute" target="rhythmLevel" midiChannel="0" data1="45" data2="0" value="0.0" enabled="1"/>

    <!-- ====================== AMP LEAD (solo) ============================= -->
    <!-- leadMid (sem "dle"); Soar e toggle -->
    <routing type="cc_absolute" target="leadGain" midiChannel="0" data1="46" data2="0" value="0.0" enabled="1"/>
    <routing type="cc_absolute" target="leadBass" midiChannel="0" data1="47" data2="0" value="0.0" enabled="1"/>
    <routing type="cc_absolute" target="leadMid" midiChannel="0" data1="48" data2="0" value="0.0" enabled="1"/>
    <routing type="cc_absolute" target="leadSoar" midiChannel="0" data1="49" data2="0" value="0.0" enabled="1"/>
    <routing type="cc_absolute" target="leadTreble" midiChannel="0" data1="50" data2="0" value="0.0" enabled="1"/>
    <routing type="cc_absolute" target="leadPresence" midiChannel="0" data1="51" data2="0" value="0.0" enabled="1"/>
    <routing type="cc_absolute" target="leadMaster" midiChannel="0" data1="52" data2="0" value="0.0" enabled="1"/>
    <routing type="cc_absolute" target="leadLevel" midiChannel="0" data1="53" data2="0" value="0.0" enabled="1"/>

    <!-- ============= EQ PARAMETRICO — so os toggles ======================= -->
    <!-- A app manda OFF em toda cena para o EQ do preset nao poluir o rig; as
         30 bandas ficam fora do mapa de proposito. O PIEZO nao tem EQ. -->
    <routing type="cc_absolute" target="cleanEQActive" midiChannel="0" data1="54" data2="0" value="0.0" enabled="1"/>
    <routing type="cc_absolute" target="rhythmEQActive" midiChannel="0" data1="55" data2="0" value="0.0" enabled="1"/>
    <routing type="cc_absolute" target="leadEQActive" midiChannel="0" data1="56" data2="0" value="0.0" enabled="1"/>

    <!-- ======================= WAH + COMP (pre) =========================== -->
    <!-- O compressor do Petrucci nao tem Attack -->
    <routing type="cc_absolute" target="wahActive" midiChannel="0" data1="57" data2="0" value="0.0" enabled="1"/>
    <routing type="cc_absolute" target="wahPosition" midiChannel="0" data1="58" data2="0" value="0.0" enabled="1"/>
    <routing type="cc_absolute" target="compressorActive" midiChannel="0" data1="59" data2="0" value="0.0" enabled="1"/>
    <routing type="cc_absolute" target="compressorCompression" midiChannel="0" data1="60" data2="0" value="0.0" enabled="1"/>
    <routing type="cc_absolute" target="compressorLevel" midiChannel="0" data1="61" data2="0" value="0.0" enabled="1"/>

    <!-- =========================== OD (pre) =============================== -->
    <routing type="cc_absolute" target="overdriveActive" midiChannel="0" data1="66" data2="0" value="0.0" enabled="1"/>
    <routing type="cc_absolute" target="overdriveDrive" midiChannel="0" data1="67" data2="0" value="0.0" enabled="1"/>
    <routing type="cc_absolute" target="overdriveTone" midiChannel="0" data1="68" data2="0" value="0.0" enabled="1"/>
    <routing type="cc_absolute" target="overdriveLevel" midiChannel="0" data1="69" data2="0" value="0.0" enabled="1"/>

    <!-- ========================= PHASER (pre) ============================= -->
    <routing type="cc_absolute" target="phaserActive" midiChannel="0" data1="70" data2="0" value="0.0" enabled="1"/>
    <routing type="cc_absolute" target="phaserRate" midiChannel="0" data1="71" data2="0" value="0.0" enabled="1"/>
    <routing type="cc_absolute" target="phaserMode" midiChannel="0" data1="72" data2="0" value="0.0" enabled="1"/>

    <!-- ========================= CHORUS (pre) ============================= -->
    <routing type="cc_absolute" target="chorusActive" midiChannel="0" data1="73" data2="0" value="0.0" enabled="1"/>
    <routing type="cc_absolute" target="chorusRate" midiChannel="0" data1="74" data2="0" value="0.0" enabled="1"/>
    <routing type="cc_absolute" target="chorusDepth" midiChannel="0" data1="75" data2="0" value="0.0" enabled="1"/>
    <routing type="cc_absolute" target="chorusLevel" midiChannel="0" data1="76" data2="0" value="0.0" enabled="1"/>
    <routing type="cc_absolute" target="chorusMode" midiChannel="0" data1="77" data2="0" value="0.0" enabled="1"/>

    <!-- ======================== FLANGER (pre) ============================= -->
    <routing type="cc_absolute" target="flangerActive" midiChannel="0" data1="78" data2="0" value="0.0" enabled="1"/>
    <routing type="cc_absolute" target="flangerRate" midiChannel="0" data1="79" data2="0" value="0.0" enabled="1"/>
    <routing type="cc_absolute" target="flangerDepth" midiChannel="0" data1="80" data2="0" value="0.0" enabled="1"/>
    <routing type="cc_absolute" target="flangerRange" midiChannel="0" data1="81" data2="0" value="0.0" enabled="1"/>
    <routing type="cc_absolute" target="flangerFeedback" midiChannel="0" data1="82" data2="0" value="0.0" enabled="1"/>

    <!-- ============================ VOLUME ================================ -->
    <!-- Secao propria entre o EQ e os pos-efeitos: e o volume da guitarra
         emulado, com o ponto medio da curva ajustavel -->
    <routing type="cc_absolute" target="volumeGain" midiChannel="0" data1="83" data2="0" value="0.0" enabled="1"/>
    <routing type="cc_absolute" target="volumeMidPoint" midiChannel="0" data1="84" data2="0" value="0.0" enabled="1"/>

    <!-- ======================== CHORUS 2 (pos) ============================ -->
    <routing type="cc_absolute" target="chorus2Active" midiChannel="0" data1="85" data2="0" value="0.0" enabled="1"/>
    <routing type="cc_absolute" target="chorus2Mix" midiChannel="0" data1="86" data2="0" value="0.0" enabled="1"/>
    <routing type="cc_absolute" target="chorus2Rate" midiChannel="0" data1="87" data2="0" value="0.0" enabled="1"/>
    <routing type="cc_absolute" target="chorus2Depth" midiChannel="0" data1="88" data2="0" value="0.0" enabled="1"/>
    <routing type="cc_absolute" target="chorus2Mode" midiChannel="0" data1="89" data2="0" value="0.0" enabled="1"/>

    <!-- ========================== DLY (pos) =============================== -->
    <!-- Delay duplo: Time L e Time R sao independentes. Os cortes, o sync, as
         notas sincronizadas, o tempo, o crossfeed e o crystals ficam fora. -->
    <routing type="cc_absolute" target="delayActive" midiChannel="0" data1="90" data2="0" value="0.0" enabled="1"/>
    <routing type="cc_absolute" target="delayMix" midiChannel="0" data1="91" data2="0" value="0.0" enabled="1"/>
    <routing type="cc_absolute" target="delayTimeL" midiChannel="0" data1="92" data2="0" value="0.0" enabled="1"/>
    <routing type="cc_absolute" target="delayTimeR" midiChannel="0" data1="93" data2="0" value="0.0" enabled="1"/>
    <routing type="cc_absolute" target="delayFeedback" midiChannel="0" data1="94" data2="0" value="0.0" enabled="1"/>
    <routing type="cc_absolute" target="delayMode" midiChannel="0" data1="95" data2="0" value="0.0" enabled="1"/>
    <routing type="cc_absolute" target="delayTape" midiChannel="0" data1="96" data2="0" value="0.0" enabled="1"/>
    <routing type="cc_absolute" target="delayModulation" midiChannel="0" data1="97" data2="0" value="0.0" enabled="1"/>

    <!-- ========================== RVB (pos) =============================== -->
    <routing type="cc_absolute" target="reverbActive" midiChannel="0" data1="98" data2="0" value="0.0" enabled="1"/>
    <routing type="cc_absolute" target="reverbMix" midiChannel="0" data1="99" data2="0" value="0.0" enabled="1"/>
    <routing type="cc_absolute" target="reverbDecay" midiChannel="0" data1="100" data2="0" value="0.0" enabled="1"/>
    <routing type="cc_absolute" target="reverbPreDelay" midiChannel="0" data1="101" data2="0" value="0.0" enabled="1"/>
    <routing type="cc_absolute" target="reverbShimmer" midiChannel="0" data1="102" data2="0" value="0.0" enabled="1"/>

    <!-- ================= Bypass de secao (sempre ligado) ================== -->
    <!-- Sete secoes, contra cinco do Tim Henson: o Petrucci separa Wah+Comp dos
         demais pre-efeitos e tem uma secao Volume propria. Os sete confirmados.

         O CC 110 precisou de uma segunda rodada: o primeiro export voltou com
         `wahActive`, que e o toggle do PEDAL de wah e ja estava no CC 57 —
         entrada errada do dropdown, nao o nome da secao. Remapeado por "Active
         Wah Comp Section", o nome real e `wahCompActiveID`, que fecha o padrao
         das seis outras: secao de efeito leva sufixo ID (wahComp, preFX,
         volume, postFX), secao de cadeia de sinal nao (amp, cab, eq). -->
    <routing type="cc_absolute" target="wahCompActiveID" midiChannel="0" data1="110" data2="0" value="1.0" enabled="1"/>
    <routing type="cc_absolute" target="preFXActiveID" midiChannel="0" data1="111" data2="0" value="1.0" enabled="1"/>
    <routing type="cc_absolute" target="ampActive" midiChannel="0" data1="112" data2="0" value="1.0" enabled="1"/>
    <routing type="cc_absolute" target="cabActive" midiChannel="0" data1="113" data2="0" value="1.0" enabled="1"/>
    <routing type="cc_absolute" target="eqActive" midiChannel="0" data1="114" data2="0" value="1.0" enabled="1"/>
    <routing type="cc_absolute" target="volumeActiveID" midiChannel="0" data1="115" data2="0" value="1.0" enabled="1"/>
    <routing type="cc_absolute" target="postFXActiveID" midiChannel="0" data1="116" data2="0" value="1.0" enabled="1"/>

  </routings>
</midi>
